        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlomba kwa ng'wa Yehoshafati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya shikū ba Moabu na Baamoni hamò na Baeuni biza kūng'ūūbūkīla ū Yehoshafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū balebe būng'wīla ū Yehoshafati, “Ibità itaale kūfuma Edomu kū ntambūko gwa nyanza līliza kūkūūbūkīla, nīyo ī haha lyashikaga Hazazoni-tamali” (hū kūhaya Engedi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati wibakīla, hūna ūbona hambū hambū amūje SEEBA; ūfunya shilagīlo sha kūfunga, hose pyī ū mu sī ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Yuda biza a bose kūkooba būgunanhi bo ng'wa SEEBA; nīyo biza kūfuma būlī nzengo bakūnkoobaga ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yehoshafati wīmīīla ū kū būtongi wa banhū ba Yuda na Yelusalemu, a bose abo baalī bibilinga a ha hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ū kū būtongi wa gwaalugwa ī mhya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Ee SEEBA, Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bise, ū bebe ūtī Mulungu ūyo alī ng'wigūlū? Ū bebe hū ūlī nsugi wa būtemi wa mahanga gose na gose. Ū būdūla nī nguzu shilī mu nkono gwako, atīho wa kūkūchaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Mulungu wise, ūtī bebe ūyo ūkabapeeja a bikaji ba mu sī yenīyī būbīngīla a banhū bako a Baisilaeli, a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Abulahamu ū nwani wako, ūbinha gīkī ībize yabo ilalī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ī haha balī bikaji baamo, na'ipandī lyeela baazenga kūlwa nguno ya lina lyako; bakūhayaga gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ūlū mhayo gose gose gwabūbi gūtwizīīla, lūbize lūshū lwa kwenha nsango nūūlū ihūūya, nūūlū nzala, tūkwīmīīla mu būtongi wako ū kū būtongi wa hekalu yenīyī, nguno ī lina lyako līl'ū mu hekalu yenīyī. Ū mu makoye gise tūkūkūlīlīīla, nang'ho ūkūtwigwa ūtūpīje.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo lūūlū, ī haha baaba banhū ba kūfuma Amoni, Moabu na kū sī ya lūgūlū lwa Seili, abo sī yabo walī ūtabazunīlīgije a Baisilaeli kwīdumīla aho bafumaga Misili. Na lūūlū bakagalūka būbīngīla, būleka ū kūbakenaagūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha ūlībona īyo balītūshokeja, bizaga kūtūpeeja ū mu sī īyo watwinha gīkī ībize ya wingīji wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Mulungu wise, ūkūbaleka dūhū na kūbinha nsango yaya? A bise tūtī na nguzu ja kūlyīmīla ī libità īlo lizaga kūtūūbūkīla lyenīlī. Tūtūmanaga tūkwīta mhayo kī, alīyo a miso gise galī kūlī bebe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kūbatimbya ng'holò",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagosha ba Yuda a bose na a bake babo, na a baana babo baalī bīmīīla ho a henaho kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wizīīla Yahazieli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zakalia, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Benaya, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yeieli, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Matania, ūmò wa Balawī, wa shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Asafu, aho īmīīlile ū ng'wibità lya banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Degelekaga ntemi Yehoshafati, na a bing'we bose a bikaji ba Yuda na Yelusalemu! Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Mutizogoha nūūlū mutizūgwa ng'holò kūlwa nguno y'ibità lyenīlī nūūlū īkī līlī itaale. Nguno ū būlūgū būtī wing'we, alīyo bo ng'wa Mulungu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ntondo būkagi muje koi mukapamanye nabo, bakwiza na nzīla ya kūlinha kūbītīla ing'ong'ho lya Zīzī; mukūbasangīla ū kū ngelelo ya longa mu sī y'itogolo lya Yelūli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mutūbūlwa ū būlūgū wenūbū, gwike dūhū būlī ūmò wing'we akwīmīīla hīgīyī ha lwandī lwakwe mubūbone ū būpīji ūbo alīng'winha ū SEEBA. Ee Yuda na Yelusalemu, lekagi ū kogoha, yaya ū kūgwa ng'holò. Ī ntondo jagi mukamanhye nabo, ū SEEBA akūbiza hamò ning'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati winama ū būshū wakwe kūshisha hasī; a banhū a bose a ba Yuda nī Yelusalemu būgwa hasī ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA bakūnamyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balawī balebe ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Kohati na Koola bīmīīla būnkumīlīja n'ilaka lya higūlya ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būpīji kūfuma kūlī SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo yaho bipuuna dilū, būbūūka bajile kwitogolo lya Tekoa. Aho bandya kūja, ū Yehoshafati wīmīīla ūhaya, “Nidegelekagi banhū ba Yuda na a bana Yelusalemu! Nsanyagi ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we mukūpandīka nguzu; basanyagi na a bahangi bakwe īkūmubeelela ī mihayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati aho wamala kūlūngalūnga na a banhū, ūsolanhya banhū ba kūng'wīmbīla ū SEEBA na kūnkumīlīja kūlwa wiza bo wela wakwe; būtongela ū kū būtongi w'ibità būja bakwīmbaga, “Nūmbagi ū SEEBA, nguno ū būtogwa wakwe būlī wa welelo na welelo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bandya kwīmba na kūkumīlīja, ū SEEBA ūbalwisanya a banhū abo baalī biza kwīdumīla Yuda; a Baamoni na a Bamoabu, na a ba kūfuma kū lūgūlū lwa Seili, bimala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baamoni na Bamoabu būbūūbūkīla a ba kūfuma kū lūgūlū lwa Seili, būbakenaagūla na kūbamala pye gete. Aho bamala ū kūbakenaagūla a bana Seili, biyandya nabo kwisengagūla shū kūshisha bimala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Yuda aho bashika a h'ipandī lya higūlya īlo lilolile nī litogolo, bahayūponya a miso ū kwibità ī litaale lyenīlo; būbona mibimba dūhū īlambalalile hasī; walī atapūlūgūkile nūūlū ūmò wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yehoshafati na a banhū bakwe būja kūsola shikolo dūhū. Būsanga moi shikolo shingī no, na shizwalo, na shikolo sha mpango ntaale; shalī shingī shitī na būmalīle ū kūshibūūcha. Ī shikolo shalī shingī no, shikabasola shikū idatū ū kūshikuminga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lwa kanè būūkibilinga mu sī ya ntubīlo ya Balaaka, bandya kūnkumīlīja ū SEEBA; h'ī nguno yene ī sī yenīyo īkitanagwa ya ntubīlo gwa Balaaka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Balaaka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, kūkumīlīja.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kūshisha lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū ba Yuda būshoka Yelusalemu abatongeelile ū Yehoshafati, bigwaga ū kūyega īkī ū SEEBA walī wabinha nguno ya kūyega, kūlwa kūpyenwa kwa banishi babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bingīla ī Yelusalemu na ndono jabo na mbiilūlū, na mhembe; būlūmbūlīla mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyogohya lya ng'wa SEEBA lyūgagwīla pye a mabūsugi ga mu masī, aho bigwa ūmo SEEBA akabalwīlīīla a Baisilaeli ū kū banishi babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū būtemi bo ng'wa Yehoshafati būbiza mu mhola, nguno ū Mulungu wakwe akang'wifuuja būlī kwene ū mu mhandī jose ījo jalī jimpīndije.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būkalīkījo bo ng'wa Yehoshafati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'īyo ī ya būsugi bo ng'wa Yehoshafati ū mu Yuda; aho alandya kūsuga walī na myaka makūmi adatū n'ītanò. Ūtema ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī n'ītanò alī mu Yelusalemu. Ū nina ī lina lyakwe witanagwa Azuba, nshīke o ng'wa Shihili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akashimīzīla mu nzīla ja ng'wa ise Asa, atajilekile, wīta yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a mapandī ga higūlya gatīnjiwe, na a banhū baalī bataalī ū kūjilogeja chiza ī ng'holò jabo ū kūlī Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būsugi bo ng'wa Yehoshafati, kūfuma wandījo wayo kūshisha kū būkalīkījo, yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja ng'wa Yehu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hanaani, hūna yandīkwa mu shitabo sha batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kū shikū ja kū būtongi ū Yehoshafati akanwana na Ahazia ntemi wa Isilaeli ūyo walī ng'wīti wa mihayo ya malofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bizunīlīja kūbeeja meeli ja būsūlūja, ja kūyūja Talishishi. Aho jamala kūbeejiwa ī Ezioni-geba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elieza ng'witūnja o ng'wa Dodavahu muna Malesha ūng'hangīla ū Yehoshafati alīhaya, “Īkī wanwanile na Ahazia, ū SEEBA akūshikenaagūla īsho ng'wabeegije.” Ī meeli jenījo jūkenaagūka, jitadūgije ū kūja ū kū būsūlūja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
